      <title>Building app sandboxes on top of LXC and KVM with libvirt</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Virtualization and Cloud Devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The libvirt library provides a hypervisor agnostic API for interacting with &amp;amp; managing virtualization hosts. Traditional uses of virtualization have focused on running entire operating systems in virtual machines or containers. The libvirt-sandbox library builds on libvirt, LXC &amp;amp; KVM, providing an API which facilitates the use of virtualization as a tool for building secure application sandboxes, without the additional burden of maintaining additional OS installations.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
